{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 13.6, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Validate v3 word-boundary matching improvement on existing PyPI data using larger sample size. Document decision for future Hackage/Metacpan Haskell package experiment. Continue mission evidence-gathering workflow. Do not restart discovery each session - continue across sessions per protocol.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "Built view-count prototype v3 with word-boundary matching, keyword-enhanced classification, and prioritized package ranking. Tested with multiple keywords. Principle tested across 16 domains with no candidate validated for sustained use. Boundary conditions mapped: works on PyPI/NPM/Discourse (sufficient scale), fails on GitHub issues/web search/Chemistry SE/GitHub code repos. V3 improvements: reduces substring false positives, checks project name, graceful API failure fallback, prioritizes active packages with most need indicators. Decision: prototype phase complete, boundary conditions established. Single most useful next action: initiate fresh view-count experiment in new domain per D083 - recommended Hackage/Metacpan (Haskell packages) to narrow principle's boundary conditions into registry domain for functional/languages. Immediate step: validate v3 improvement on existing PyPI data, document for future Haskell experiment.", "unlogged_changes": 26}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 28, "session": "2026-10-14-013-document-v3-prototype-decision-and-initi", "ts": "2026-10-14T10:00:16+00:00"}
